  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your habit of wanting to show your true colors in battle shines through, granting you the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>You learn the Charm Person creation. You can use it once without spending a Creation slot, and you gain the ability to do so when you finish a long rest. You also have the Allure Cantrip. Both these creations use your Charisma modifier.</li><li>You gain an Unarmored AC equal to 10 + your Charisma modifier + your Dexterity modifier. You lose this AC if you are wearing armor or holding a shield.</li></ul>",
